03271442838013172}, {"id": 53, "seek": 12000, "start": 130.02, "end": 131.48, "text": " and healed all who were sick.", "tokens": [50866, 293, 20482, 439, 567, 645, 4998, 13, 50939], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22296833169871363, "compression_ratio": 1.6141732283464567, "no_speech_prob": 0.003271442838013172}, {"id": 54, "seek": 12000, "start": 132.2, "end": 135.42, "text": " This was to fulfill what was spoken by the prophet Isaiah.", "tokens": [50975, 639, 390, 281, 13875, 437, 390, 10759, 538, 264, 18566, 27263, 13, 51136], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22296833169871363, "compression_ratio": 1.6141732283464567, "no_speech_prob": 0.003271442838013172}, {"id": 55, "seek": 12000, "start": 136.22, "end": 139.44, "text": " He took our illnesses and bore our diseases.", "tokens": [51176, 634, 1890, 527, 30791, 293, 26002, 527, 11044, 13, 51337], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22296833169871363, "compression_ratio": 1.6141732283464567, "no_speech_prob": 0.003271442838013172}, {"id": 56, "seek": 12000, "start": 141.26, "end": 143.6, "text": " Now when Jesus saw a crowd around him,", "tokens": [51428, 823, 562, 2705, 1866, 257, 6919, 926, 796, 11, 51545], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22296833169871363, "compression_ratio": 1.6141732283464567, "no_speech_prob": 0.003271442838013172}, {"id": 57, "seek": 12000, "start": 143.6, "end": 146.02, "text": " he gave orders to go over to the other side.", "tokens": [51545, 415, 2729, 9470, 281, 352, 670, 281, 264, 661, 1252, 13, 51666], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22296833169871363, "compression_ratio": 1.6141732283464567, "no_speech_prob": 0.003271442838013172}, {"id": 58, "seek": 12000, "start": 146.52, "end": 148.52, "text": " And a scribe came up and said to him,", "tokens": [51691, 400, 257, 5545, 650, 1361, 493, 293, 848, 281, 796, 11, 51791], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22296833169871363, "compression_ratio": 1.6141732283464567, "no_speech_prob": 0.003271442838013172}, {"id": 59, "seek": 12000, "start": 149.02, "end": 149.66, "text": " Teacher,", "tokens": [51816, 19745, 11, 51848], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22296833169871363, "compression_ratio": 1.6141732283464567, "no_speech_prob": 0.003271442838013172}, {"id": 60, "seek": 15000, "start": 150.0, "end": 152.74, "text": " I will follow you wherever you go.", "tokens": [50365, 286, 486, 1524, 291, 8660, 291, 352, 13, 50502], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2436845220368484, "compression_ratio": 1.7547169811320755, "no_speech_prob": 0.003217850113287568}, {"id": 61, "seek": 15000, "start": 153.42, "end": 154.96, "text": " And Jesus said to him,", "tokens": [50536, 400, 2705, 848, 281, 796, 11, 50613], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2436845220368484, "compression_ratio": 1.7547169811320755, "no_speech_prob": 0.003217850113287568}, {"id": 62, "seek": 15000, "start": 155.76, "end": 156.88, "text": " Foxes have holes,", "tokens": [50653, 11388, 279, 362, 8118, 11, 50709], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2436845220368484, "compression_ratio": 1.7547169811320755, "no_speech_prob": 0.003217850113287568}, {"id": 63, "seek": 15000, "start": 157.26, "end": 158.88, "text": " and birds of the air have nests,", "tokens": [50728, 293, 9009, 295, 264, 1988, 362, 297, 4409, 11, 50809], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2436845220368484, "compression_ratio": 1.7547169811320755, "no_speech_prob": 0.003217850113287568}, {"id": 64, "seek": 15000, "start": 159.42, "end": 162.26, "text": " but the Son of Man has nowhere to lay his head.", "tokens": [50836, 457, 264, 5185, 295, 2458, 575, 11159, 281, 2360, 702, 1378, 13, 50978], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2436845220368484, "compression_ratio": 1.7547169811320755, "no_speech_prob": 0.003217850113287568}, {"id": 65, "seek": 15000, "start": 163.04, "end": 164.9, "text": " Another of the disciples said to him,", "tokens": [51017, 3996, 295, 264, 17209, 848, 281, 796, 11, 51110], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2436845220368484, "compression_ratio": 1.7547169811320755, "no_speech_prob": 0.003217850113287568}, {"id": 66, "seek": 15000, "start": 165.64, "end": 168.08, "text": " Lord, let me first go and bury my father.", "tokens": [51147, 3257, 11, 718, 385, 700, 352, 293, 28919, 452, 3086, 13, 51269], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2436845220368484, "compression_ratio": 1.7547169811320755, "no_speech_prob": 0.003217850113287568}, {"id": 67, "seek": 15000, "start": 168.78, "end": 170.02, "text": " And Jesus said to him,", "tokens": [51304, 400, 2705, 848, 281, 796, 11, 51366], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2436845220368484, "compression_ratio": 1.7547169811320755, "no_speech_prob": 0.003217850113287568}, {"id": 68, "seek": 15000, "start": 170.64, "end": 171.82, "text": " Follow me,", "tokens": [51397, 9876, 385, 11, 51456], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2436845220368484, "compression_ratio": 1.7547169811320755, "no_speech_prob": 0.003217850113287568}, {"id": 69, "seek": 15000, "start": 172.06, "end": 174.76, "text": " and leave the dead to bury their own dead.", "tokens": [51468, 293, 1856, 264, 3116, 281, 28919, 641, 1065, 3116, 13, 51603], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2436845220368484, "compression_ratio": 1.7547169811320755, "no_speech_prob": 0.003217850113287568}, {"id": 70, "seek": 15000, "start": 176.46, "end": 178.12, "text": " And when he got into the boat,", "tokens": [51688, 400, 562, 415, 658, 666, 264, 6582, 11, 51771], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2436845220368484, "compression_ratio": 1.7547169811320755, "no_speech_prob": 0.003217850113287568}, {"id": 71, "seek": 15000, "start": 178.22, "end": 179.38, "text": " his disciples followed him.", "tokens": [51776, 702, 17209, 6263, 796, 13, 51834], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2436845220368484, "compression_ratio": 1.7547169811320755, "no_speech_prob": 0.003217850113287568}, {"id": 72, "seek": 18000, "start": 180.0, "end": 182.46, "text": " Behold, there arose a great storm on the sea,", "tokens": [50365, 879, 4104, 11, 456, 37192, 257, 869, 7679, 322, 264, 4158, 11, 50488], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.26953878322569264, "compression_ratio": 1.6199095022624435, "no_speech_prob": 0.002949715591967106}, {"id": 73, "seek": 18000, "start": 182.58, "end": 184.98, "text": " so that the boat was being swamped by the waves.", "tokens": [50494, 370, 300, 264, 6582, 390, 885, 31724, 292, 538, 264, 9417, 13, 50614], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.26953878322569264, "compression_ratio": 1.6199095022624435, "no_speech_prob": 0.002949715591967106}, {"id": 74, "seek": 18000, "start": 185.34, "end": 186.3, "text": " But he was asleep.", "tokens": [50632, 583, 415, 390, 11039, 13, 50680], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.26953878322569264, "compression_ratio": 1.6199095022624435, "no_speech_prob": 0.002949715591967106}, {"id": 75, "seek": 18000, "start": 186.82, "end": 188.62, "text": " And they went and woke him, saying,", "tokens": [50706, 400, 436, 1437, 293, 12852, 796, 11, 1566, 11, 50796], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.26953878322569264, "compression_ratio": 1.6199095022624435, "no_speech_prob": 0.002949715591967106}, {"id": 76, "seek": 18000, "start": 189.42, "end": 191.72, "text": " Save us, Lord, we are perishing.", "tokens": [50836, 15541, 505, 11, 3257, 11, 321, 366, 680, 3807, 13, 50951], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.26953878322569264, "compression_ratio": 1.6199095022624435, "no_speech_prob": 0.002949715591967106}, {"id": 77, "seek": 18000, "start": 192.58, "end": 193.84, "text": " And he said to them,", "tokens": [50994, 400, 415, 848, 281, 552, 11, 51057], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.26953878322569264, "compression_ratio": 1.6199095022624435, "no_speech_prob": 0.002949715591967106}, {"id": 78, "seek": 18000, "start": 194.7, "end": 198.04, "text": " Why are you afraid, O you of little faith?", "tokens": [51100, 1545, 366, 291, 4638, 11, 422, 291, 295, 707, 4522, 30, 51267], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.26953878322569264, "compression_ratio": 1.6199095022624435, "no_speech_prob": 0.002949715591967106}, {"id": 79, "seek": 18000, "start": 198.84, "end": 202.5, "text": " Then he rose and rebuked the winds and the sea.", "tokens": [51307, 1396, 415, 10895, 293, 12970, 2034, 292, 264, 17765, 293, 264, 4158, 13, 51490], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.26953878322569264, "compression_ratio": 1.6199095022624435, "no_speech_prob": 0.002949715591967106}, {"id": 80, "seek": 18000, "start": 203.28, "end": 205.28, "text": " And there was a great calm.", "tokens": [51529, 400, 456, 390, 257, 869, 7151, 13, 51629], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.26953878322569264, "compression_ratio": 1.6199095022624435, "no_speech_prob": 0.002949715591967106}, {"id": 81, "seek": 18000, "start": 206.12, "end": 208.8, "text": " And the men marveled, saying,", "tokens": [51671, 400, 264, 1706, 23893, 292, 11, 1566, 11, 51805], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.26953878322569264, "compression_ratio": 1.6199095022624435, "no_speech_prob": 0.002949715591967106}, {"id": 82, "seek": 18000, "start": 209.12, "end": 209.84, "text": " What?", "tokens": [51821, 708, 30, 51857], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.26953878322569264, "compression_ratio": 1.6199095022624435, "no_speech_prob": 0.002949715591967106}, {"id": 83, "seek": 20984, "start": 209.84, "end": 211.34, "text": " What sort of man is this,", "tokens": [50365, 708, 1333, 295, 587, 307, 341, 11, 50440], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1808304637670517, "compression_ratio": 1.6095617529880477, "no_speech_prob": 0.0012064313050359488}, {"id": 84, "seek": 20984, "start": 211.62, "end": 213.72, "text": " that even winds and sea obey him?", "tokens": [50454, 300, 754, 17765, 293, 4158, 19297, 796, 30, 50559], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1808304637670517, "compression_ratio": 1.6095617529880477, "no_speech_prob": 0.0012064313050359488}, {"id": 85, "seek": 20984, "start": 214.38, "end": 216.02, "text": " And when he came to the other side,", "tokens": [50592, 400, 562, 415, 1361, 281, 264, 661, 1252, 11, 50674], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1808304637670517, "compression_ratio": 1.6095617529880477, "no_speech_prob": 0.0012064313050359488}, {"id": 86, "seek": 20984, "start": 216.36, "end": 217.76, "text": " to the country of the Gadarenes,", "tokens": [50691, 281, 264, 1941, 295, 264, 37171, 543, 4081, 11, 50761], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1808304637670517, "compression_ratio": 1.6095617529880477, "no_speech_prob": 0.0012064313050359488}, {"id": 87, "seek": 20984, "start": 218.1, "end": 220.16, "text": " two demon-possessed men met him,", "tokens": [50778, 732, 14283, 12, 79, 772, 10830, 1706, 1131, 796, 11, 50881], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1808304637670517, "compression_ratio": 1.6095617529880477, "no_speech_prob": 0.0012064313050359488}, {"id": 88, "seek": 20984, "start": 220.28, "end": 221.5, "text": " coming out of the tombs,", "tokens": [50887, 1348, 484, 295, 264, 2916, 929, 11, 50948], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1808304637670517, "compression_ratio": 1.6095617529880477, "no_speech_prob": 0.0012064313050359488}, {"id": 89, "seek": 20984, "start": 221.7, "end": 224.54, "text": " so fierce that no one could pass that way.", "tokens": [50958, 370, 25341, 300, 572, 472, 727, 1320, 300, 636, 13, 51100], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1808304637670517, "compression_ratio": 1.6095617529880477, "no_speech_prob": 0.0012064313050359488}, {"id": 90, "seek": 20984, "start": 225.02, "end": 226.46, "text": " And behold, they cried out,", "tokens": [51124, 400, 27234, 11, 436, 16266, 484, 11, 51196], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1808304637670517, "compression_ratio": 1.6095617529880477, "no_speech_prob": 0.0012064313050359488}, {"id": 91, "seek": 20984, "start": 227.24, "end": 231.34, "text": " What have you to do with us, O Son of God?", "tokens": [51235, 708, 362, 291, 281, 360, 365, 505, 11, 422, 5185, 295, 1265, 30, 51440], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1808304637670517, "compression_ratio": 1.6095617529880477, "no_speech_prob": 0.0012064313050359488}, {"id": 92, "seek": 20984, "start": 231.7, "end": 235.98000000000002, "text": " Have you come here to torment us before the time?", "tokens": [51458, 3560, 291, 808, 510, 281, 36662, 505, 949, 264, 565, 30, 51672], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1808304637670517, "compression_ratio": 1.6095617529880477, "no_speech_prob": 0.0012064313050359488}, {"id": 93, "seek": 20984, "start": 236.42000000000002, "end": 239.1, "text": " Now a herd of many pigs was feeding", "tokens": [51694, 823, 257, 29484, 295, 867, 24380, 390, 12919, 51828], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1808304637670517, "compression_ratio": 1.6095617529880477, "no_speech_prob": 0.0012064313050359488}, {"id": 94, "seek": 20984, "start": 239.1, "end": 239.82, "text": " at some distance,", "tokens": [51828, 412, 512, 4560, 11, 51864], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1808304637670517, "compression_ratio": 1.6095617529880477, "no_speech_prob": 0.0012064313050359488}, {"id": 95, "seek": 23984, "start": 239.96, "end": 242.46, "text": " and the demons begged him, saying,", "tokens": [50371, 293, 264, 19733, 47653, 796, 11, 1566, 11, 50496], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.26150427924262154, "compression_ratio": 1.711111111111111, "no_speech_prob": 0.009690139442682266}, {"id": 96, "seek": 23984, "start": 243.22, "end": 248.88, "text": " If you cast us out, send us away into the herd of pigs.", "tokens": [50534, 759, 291, 4193, 505, 484, 11, 2845, 505, 1314, 666, 264, 29484, 295, 24380, 13, 50817], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.26150427924262154, "compression_ratio": 1.711111111111111, "no_speech_prob": 0.009690139442682266}, {"id": 97, "seek": 23984, "start": 249.58, "end": 251.12, "text": " And he said to them,", "tokens": [50852, 400, 415, 848, 281, 552, 11, 50929], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.26150427924262154, "compression_ratio": 1.711111111111111, "no_speech_prob": 0.009690139442682266}, {"id": 98, "seek": 23984, "start": 251.9, "end": 252.4, "text": " Go.", "tokens": [50968, 1037, 13, 50993], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.26150427924262154, "compression_ratio": 1.711111111111111, "no_speech_prob": 0.009690139442682266}, {"id": 99, "seek": 23984, "start": 253.26, "end": 255.68, "text": " So they came out and went into the pigs,", "tokens": [51036, 407, 436, 1361, 484, 293, 1437, 666, 264, 24380, 11, 51157], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.26150427924262154, "compression_ratio": 1.711111111111111, "no_speech_prob": 0.009690139442682266}, {"id": 100, "seek": 23984, "start": 255.8, "end": 258.9, "text": " and behold, the whole herd rushed down the steep bank", "tokens": [51163, 293, 27234, 11, 264, 1379, 29484, 24421, 760, 264, 16841, 3765, 51318], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.26150427924262154, "compression_ratio": 1.711111111111111, "no_speech_prob": 0.009690139442682266}, {"id": 101, "seek": 23984, "start": 258.9, "end": 260.88, "text": " into the sea and drowned in the waters.", "tokens": [51318, 666, 264, 4158, 293, 38233, 294, 264, 12975, 13, 51417], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.26150427924262154, "compression_ratio": 1.711111111111111, "no_speech_prob": 0.009690139442682266}, {"id": 102, "seek": 23984, "start": 261.58, "end": 263.96, "text": " The herdsmen fled, and going into the city,", "tokens": [51452, 440, 720, 16063, 2558, 24114, 11, 293, 516, 666, 264, 2307, 11, 51571], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.26150427924262154, "compression_ratio": 1.711111111111111, "no_speech_prob": 0.009690139442682266}, {"id": 103, "seek": 23984, "start": 264.04, "end": 265.02, "text": " they told everything,", "tokens": [51575, 436, 1907, 1203, 11, 51624], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.26150427924262154, "compression_ratio": 1.711111111111111, "no_speech_prob": 0.009690139442682266}, {"id": 104, "seek": 23984, "start": 265.4,